================================================================================
TESTING — COMPREHENSIVE PLAN
================================================================================
Consolidated, prioritized test backlog (drafted 2026-08-03). Convention: ✔ = done
(file noted), ◐ = partial, ☐ = to write. "Equiv" = sim ≡ transpiled SystemVerilog
under Verilator via tests/common (the project correctness bar). "Oracle" = sim (or
transpiled SV) checked against an independent Rust reference. Verilator-dependent
tests are slower; oracle-only tests are pure `cargo test`.

Shared harness reference: tests/common/mod.rs (EquivalenceTest), fixture pattern
= tests/fixtures/*_dut.rs (`include!` for sim + `include_str!` for transpile).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
